    {
      "id": "copilot-features", "type": "text", "x": 55, "y": 215, "width": 330, "height": 280,
      "text": "✅ Uses MSVC debugger natively\n\n✅ IntelliSense-powered suggestions\n\n✅ MSBuild / .sln / .vcxproj support\n\n✅ PR code review on GitHub\n\n✅ @Modernize agent for C++\n\n✅ IP indemnity (legal protection)\n\n✅ Code completions — UNLIMITED\n\n✅ One tool, one login, one workflow\n\n✅ Backed by Microsoft\n\n💰 50 devs = $11,400/year\n💰 75 devs = $17,100/year",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
