    {
      "id": "cursor-features", "type": "text", "x": 505, "y": 215, "width": 330, "height": 280,
      "text": "❌ No MSVC debugger support\n\n❌ No native MSBuild integration\n\n❌ No .sln / .vcxproj support\n\n❌ No IP indemnity\n\n⚠️ Requires \"hybrid\" workflow\n    (VS + Cursor side by side)\n\n✅ Multi-file refactoring (Composer)\n\n✅ Multiple AI model choices\n\n⚠️ Still needs GitHub for VCS\n\n💰 50 devs = $24,000/year (+$12,600)\n💰 75 devs = $36,000/year (+$18,900)\n\n⚠️ 2x the cost, no VS integration",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left",
